## \ud83c\udfaf Key Takeaways

### 1. Token Minting Timing

| Stage | Old (Wrong) | New (Correct) |
|-------|-------------|---------------|
| **Farmer creates batch** | \u274c Token minted | \u2705 No token |
| **Commission event** | IPFS + blockchain | IPFS + blockchain |
| **QR sent to farmer** | Token already exists | No token yet |
| **Cooperative verifies** | Already tokenized | \u2705 Token minted here |

**Result**: Only verified batches get on-chain representation.

### 2. Quantity Reconciliation

```
Farmer claim:          150.0 kg  (batch.quantity)
Cooperative verified:  145.0 kg  (batch.verified_quantity)
Token minted:          145,000 grams (verified!)
On-chain data:         Matches physical reality
```

**Why different?**
- Moisture loss during drying
- Removal of defective beans
- Weight verification using calibrated scale

### 3. Custody Model

| Layer | Owner | Purpose |
|-------|-------|---------|
| **Physical** | Cooperative warehouse | Holds coffee |
| **Blockchain (ERC-1155)** | Cooperative wallet | Token custody |
| **Database** | Farmer (created_by_user_id) | Attribution |
| **DID** | Farmer (created_by_did) | Identity |
| **Settlement** | Farmer | Payment recipient |

**Result**: Custody matches physical reality, farmer gets credit and payment.

### 4. Integration Points

```
voice/command_integration.py
  \u2514\u2500 Farmer creates batch \u2192 PENDING_VERIFICATION
     \u2502
     v
database/models.py
  \u2514\u2500 CoffeeBatch record (token_id = NULL)
     \u2502
     v
voice/telegram/verification_handler.py
  \u2514\u2500 Cooperative verifies \u2192 VERIFIED
     \u2502
     v
blockchain/token_manager.py
  \u2514\u2500 mint_batch() \u2192 Web3 transaction
     \u2502
     v
blockchain/src/CoffeeBatchToken.sol
  \u2514\u2500 mintBatch() \u2192 ERC-1155 token created
     \u2502
     v
database/models.py
  \u2514\u2500 batch.token_id updated
```

