## \ud83d\udcca Performance & Gas Costs

**Deployment**:
- Gas used: 4,641,311
- Cost: 0.000006502 ETH (~$0.02 at current prices)

**Per-batch minting**:
- Gas used: ~150,000 - 200,000 (depends on metadata size)
- Cost: ~0.000001 ETH (~$0.003)

**Why IR optimizer?**
- `via_ir = true` in `foundry.toml`
- Enables intermediate representation optimization
- Reduces deployed bytecode size
- 10-15% gas savings

**Scalability**:
- 1,000 batches/day \u00d7 $0.003 = $3/day
- 365,000 batches/year \u00d7 $0.003 = $1,095/year
- Affordable for cooperative scale

